<title>USA: Garnet Resources to plug exploratory well.</title>
<headline>Garnet Resources to plug exploratory well.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Garnet Resources Corp said it will plug and abandon its Turama-1 exploratory well in Papua New Guinea at a depth of 9,652 feet after an evaluation determined that sands found were water-bearing.</p>
<p>Garnet is engaged in international oil and gas exploration and production, principally in Colombia and Papua New Guinea.</p>
</text>
